display_name = "Bone arrow"
designer_notes = "A FOE'S SHOT (Luke's F1, F5, 2026-11-12, FOES_PREP.md section 6): the skeleton archer's arrow. Its wind-up IS THE TELL (the draw, 1200 ms): the server locks the aim regents.foe_shot_lock_ms before it ends and looses the arrow as it ends (its SpellDef, content/spell/foe_arrow.tres, says which missile and how fast). Its damage is this at the archer's damage_pct (30 at 55 % = 16.5). range_m MUST stay 0 and judged off: the missile carries the hit (the server refuses the shot otherwise)."
